WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.827
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:24.578
I'm a garden snail.

3
00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:31.117
I'm a gastropod.

4
00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:39.284
Gastropods have soft bodies and no bones.

5
00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:42.311
Where do you live?

6
00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:49.768
Garden snails live in gardens and forests.

7
00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:55.167
We like damp, dark places.

8
00:00:55.168 --> 00:00:59.549
Do snails hide during the day?

9
00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.152
We often hide under rocks or old logs.

10
00:01:06.153 --> 00:01:10.627
Then we come out at night.

11
00:01:10.628 --> 00:01:15.812
I love your shell!

12
00:01:15.813 --> 00:01:20.457
Our shells protect us.

13
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:29.532
Garden snails can hide inside.

14
00:01:29.533 --> 00:01:34.824
Your tentacles are cool.

15
00:01:34.825 --> 00:01:40.201
Snails have two sets of tentacles.

16
00:01:40.202 --> 00:01:45.421
Our eyes are on the top tentacles.

17
00:01:45.422 --> 00:01:54.732
We smell with our bottom tentacles.

18
00:01:54.733 --> 00:01:57.853
How fast can you move?

19
00:01:57.854 --> 00:02:06.571
Garden snails move very, very slowly.

20
00:02:06.572 --> 00:02:13.180
We leave slime trails wherever we go.

21
00:02:13.181 --> 00:02:16.158
What do you eat?

22
00:02:16.159 --> 00:02:22.559
Garden snails eat plants and old wood.

23
00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:33.036
Our tongues have thousands of tiny teeth!

24
00:02:33.037 --> 00:02:36.153
The sun is setting.

25
00:02:36.154 --> 00:02:43.430
I'm going to find something to eat!

26
00:02:43.431 --> 00:02:52.523
Good-bye, Garden Snail!
